---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout 
  title="Executive & Business Mentoring | Inside Exec Podcast | Kim Baillie"
  description="Senior business mentoring and executive coaching by Kim Baillie. Co-host of the weekly Inside Exec podcast series for business leaders worldwide."
  ogImage="/images/inside-exec-logo.jpg"
>
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <span class="separator">&rsaquo;</span>
    <span aria-current="page">Executive Mentoring</span>
  </nav>

  <article class="content-box">
    <h1>Executive & Business Mentoring</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      After almost 40 years in business leadership and advisory, I have developed a broad knowledge base that I share with senior executives, founders, and managers navigating complex management challenges.
    </p>

    <div style="margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;">
      <img src="/images/inside-exec-logo.jpg" alt="Inside Exec Podcast" style="max-width: 280px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);" />
    </div>

    <p>
      While I continue to provide tailored face-to-face mentoring for business executives, I wanted an accessible, global medium to share that knowledge and experience to help leaders on their own career and business journeys.
    </p>

    <p>
      Together with Fulyana Orsborn, I co-host the <strong>Inside Exec</strong> podcast—a weekly audio series downloaded by business professionals worldwide. Each short, focused episode tackles pragmatic workplace realities: team communication, managing upwards, performance appraisals, strategy execution, and resilience.
    </p>

    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; text-align: center;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--text-dark);">Listen to Inside Exec</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">
        Tune into hundreds of actionable episodes, search by management topic, or subscribe on your favourite podcast player.
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.inside-exec.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn" style="max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Listen on Inside-Exec.com &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
